CM_ SG_ 2485338192 sigVehicleModeRequest "Forward-Economy = SOC<=19%
Forward-Limphome Mode = SOC<=9%
Use 0x03 = STOP input to Controller for Vehicle Stoppage if there is any abnormality or below 0%SOC after certain time from Battery";
CM_ SG_ 2485338192 sigContRegenCurrentLimit_LSB "Set the REGEN current required value where battery can able to take Max.current during REGEN";
CM_ SG_ 2485338192 sigContIPCurrentLimit_LSB "Forward Mode = 110A (Continous)
Boost Mode = 140A (Peak Current for 120Secs)
Forward-Economy Mode = 80A
Forward-LimpHome Mode = 65A
Reverse  Mode = Same as Foward Mode Current

Refer 1826FF81 CAN ID for Drive Mode Details";
